      "standardized_narrative": "The report does not disclose an explicit gross prior-year reserve movement amount or a movement note by which prior year development can be calculated. The statutory financial statements show gross written premium of GBP 40.506m (2014) concentrated in Casualty, Property Insurance and Property Reinsurance. The balance sheet/technical provisions show gross claims outstanding on the balance sheet at year end but the report does not present a separate 'movement in prior year claims outstanding' (gross) note or a claims development triangle suitable to compute an aggregate prior year development figure. Consequently opening gross claims reserves and a gross prior year development figure could not be reliably extracted from the report.",
